Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.87,0:02:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are friends for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.21,0:02:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was surprised you called, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.17,0:02:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, aren't you, like,\Ngood at sports and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.33,0:02:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With water sports, I suck in\Nboth the real and virtual worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.03,0:02:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Sheyta Toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.53,0:02:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To have to go see the counselor\Non a perfect swimming day?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.29,0:02:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.05,0:02:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.81,0:02:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after I studied my butt\Noff this whole first semester.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.19,0:02:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad, because you're going to miss\Nout on seeing us in our swimsuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.13,0:02:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even though you'll be\Nwith that sexy counselor,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.79,0:02:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that doesn't mean you\Ncan leer at her instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.37,0:02:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's not my fault the counselor's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.97,0:02:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.15,0:02:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't mean it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.87,0:02:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, anyway, I better get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.71,0:02:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugu, you're in good hands with them, so\Nlisten to what they say and do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.47,0:02:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.85,0:02:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pool here might not be\Nas deep as the sea in Alpine,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.91,0:02:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's a good place to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.17,0:02:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just have fun and you'll\Nbe swimming in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.99,0:02:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck up there, Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.39,0:02:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say hi to the sexy counselor!
