Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.51,0:03:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.61,0:03:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kazuto, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.37,0:03:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kikuoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.17,0:03:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.69,0:03:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're with the virtual\Nreality section, so, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.69,0:03:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no offense, but why are you here? Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.01,0:03:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a couple of things I\Nwanted to ask you in person,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.57,0:03:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I arranged to set up this meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, this has nothing\Nto do with my grades.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.77,0:03:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, but it was the\Nonly way I'd be sure you'd show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.43,0:03:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave you two alone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.45,0:03:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you need me, I'll be\Nright next door, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.63,0:04:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might as well make yourself comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope this won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.55,0:04:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got plans later, so the faster\NI get out of here, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it won't take too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.15,0:04:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to wrap up the\NSAO and ALO incidents,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's a few things I need to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.21,0:04:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I figured the best way to\Ndo that was to have a sit-down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been over it a million\Ntimes with you guys already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.43,0:04:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you just check\Nthe player action logs?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.51,0:04:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They pretty much spell everything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.73,0:04:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.99,0:04:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we can get from the logs are\Nwho went where on any given day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.33,0:04:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for what really happened in\Nthere, we still have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.83,0:04:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know the overall picture yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.41,0:04:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,4,000 people died in\Nthe game, but for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.81,0:04:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Akihiko Kayaba were still alive, I'd\Nbe wasting his afternoon instead of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.53,0:04:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's important we find out what\NKayaba's motives really were.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.95,0:04:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know the reason why\Nhe'd make a death game like SAO.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.81,0:05:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think if I listen to your\Nstory, the whole thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.53,0:05:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might be able to get the answers I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.07,0:05:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're gonna help me out or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.21,0:05:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.05,0:05:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When all those nerve gears were being rounded\Nup for disposal, who let you keep one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.27,0:05:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and who told you what\Nhospital Asuna was in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.59,0:05:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And whose department's keeping the\Nsurvivors of SAO out of the media spotlight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.67,0:05:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth is, we've done a lot for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.49,0:05:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it's okay for me to use the\Npool even though I don't go to your school?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.91,0:05:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, we got permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.77,0:05:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our school is your school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.83,0:05:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, Rika, your swimsuit's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.43,0:05:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.55,0:05:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to get a new one because I\Nwasn't this boobalicious before SAO.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My old suit was so tight on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.61,0:05:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could say the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.75,0:06:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hardly changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.55,0:06:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look at Asuna rocking the bikini.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.69,0:06:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to hypnotize\NKirito with stripes, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.59,0:06:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not why I wore it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.47,0:06:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, this sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.11,0:06:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know I could wear\Na normal swimsuit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.39,0:06:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I mean, you said we were going\Nto use your school's pool, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.43,0:06:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your swimsuit looks totally cute, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.43,0:06:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.63,0:06:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so you, Suguha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.69,0:06:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.15,0:06:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, where do you want me to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.61,0:06:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the best place would be\Nthe day everyone got trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.33,0:06:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The date was, uh, what was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.89,0:06:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,November 6, 2022.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.37,0:06:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, it's already been\Ntwo and a half years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention, players.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.99,0:06:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I welcome you to my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:06:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.91,0:07:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Akihiko Kayaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.47,0:07:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as of this moment, I am\Nin control of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.51,0:07:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that really cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's some entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.75,0:07:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure most of you have already noticed\Nan item missing from your main menus,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.15,0:07:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the logout button.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me assure you, this is\Nnot a defect in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.57,0:07:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I repeat, this is not a defect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is how Sword Art\NOnline was designed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.27,0:07:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.11,0:07:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's important you remember the following.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.59,0:07:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no longer any way to\Nrevive someone within the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If your HP drops to zero, your avatar\Nwill be deleted from the system forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.85,0:07:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the Nerve Gear will\Nsimultaneously destroy your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one way for\Na player to escape now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.21,0:08:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must clear the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.87,0:08:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, you're gathered on floor\None, the lowest level of Aincrad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.43,0:08:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can get through the\Ndungeon and defeat the boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.75,0:08:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you may advance to the next floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.03,0:08:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defeat the boss on floor 100\Nand you will clear the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.53,0:08:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.43,0:08:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should we believe any\Nof the crap you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.81,0:08:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't clear all hundred floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.79,0:08:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's freaking impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.05,0:08:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the beta testers\Nnever made it that high!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.65,0:08:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last but not least,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.47,0:08:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've placed a little present in\Nthe item storage of every player.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.97,0:08:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.47,0:08:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mirror?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.86,0:08:51.61,Signs,BS,0,0,0,,{\fnBougan Book SSi\c&HC6C6C6&\blur0.4\fs34\frz349.9\pos(820.8,303.2)}Mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.43,0:08:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Klein?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay, Kirito? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.21,0:09:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.37,0:09:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you? I'm me. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,son of a you're a guy not 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.01,0:09:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wait a second is that you kirito but how
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.47,0:09:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the scan there's a high Density signal
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.29,0:09:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,device inside the nerve\Ngear rig it can see
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.19,0:09:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what my face looks like but how's it know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.65,0:09:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My height and body type\Nwhen you first put the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.89,0:09:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nerve gear on it had to\Ndo this calibration thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It asked you to touch your body\Nall over like this remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah you're right that's where!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.13,0:09:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It got our physical\Ndata but this is what's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.25,0:09:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the point why would anyone do this to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:10:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he's about to tell us right\Nnow you're probably wondering why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would Akihiko Kayaba, developer of\NSword Art Online and NerveGear, do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.37,0:10:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, my goal was a simple one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reason I created Sword Art Online was
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.11,0:10:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to control the fate of\Na world of my design.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kayaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I have achieved my goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.07,0:10:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made it to control the fate\Nof a world of his design, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.93,0:10:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the reason Gabe\Ngave you guys? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.37,0:10:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what'd you think when\Nyou heard him say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.13,0:10:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.19,0:10:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess all I could think about\Nwas how it was going to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.93,0:10:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There wasn't really time to\Nthink about anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I ditched Klein.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.97,0:10:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want, I'll get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you're in a jam,\Nmessage me, okay? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.71,0:11:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be seeing you, Klein.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.25,0:11:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.57,0:11:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.85,0:11:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.03,0:11:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.15,0:11:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look better like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.89,0:11:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way cooler than your avatar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.87,0:11:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I think that scruffy face\Nfits you ten times better, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.13,0:12:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.57,0:12:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.03,0:12:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This world can't beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.47,0:12:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.11,0:12:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.02,0:12:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got the pool all to ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.63,0:12:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is going to be so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last one in the running!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.77,0:12:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait up, Liz!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.49,0:12:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you stretch before going in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, whatever. Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.33,0:12:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, you win!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.13,0:12:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.85,0:12:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sneak that dorky thing in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.43,0:12:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't learn to swim Even if you're\Nstuck inside one of these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.77,0:12:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't let the air out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.31,0:12:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll sink if I don't have a floaty thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.23,0:12:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.55,0:13:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially with the floaty things\Nyou're packing in your swimsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.57,0:13:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.57,0:13:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so plump and firm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.27,0:13:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you beneath me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.47,0:13:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.61,0:13:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisbeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.35,0:13:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we start by getting you\Nused to having your face in the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.25,0:13:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the big revelation,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.35,0:13:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,most players teamed up in parties,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.91,0:13:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,figuring that was their best\Nchance at surviving SAO.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.67,0:13:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you didn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.23,0:13:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were a solo player pretty\Nmuch up until the very last phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.69,0:13:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knew you'd die for\Nreal if your HP hit zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.67,0:13:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so why would you take that kind of risk?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.83,0:13:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't start out wanting to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.89,0:13:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.43,0:13:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop cheering!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.03,0:13:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you do it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.69,0:13:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you let Diabel die?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.47,0:13:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him die?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:13:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I said! Admit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.09,0:14:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knew the technique\Nthe boss was gonna use!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have told us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.17,0:14:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Diabel would have stood a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.39,0:14:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't have had to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.25,0:14:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know why he knew!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.61,0:14:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used to be a beta tester!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.37,0:14:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.28,0:14:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knew the boss's attack patterns!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.89,0:14:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knew, but he kept it from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.47,0:14:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I bet he's not the\Nonly beta tester here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.59,0:14:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, show yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you guys think I used\Nto be a beta tester.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.75,0:14:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not cool to put me in the\Nsame class with those noobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.35,0:14:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.51,0:14:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.91,0:14:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of the thousand people who scored\Na slot in SAO's beta were rookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.43,0:14:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were so green, they didn't\Neven know how to level up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell, even you guys are\Nbetter than they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.39,0:15:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But me, I'm nothing like those guys, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.59,0:15:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During the beta, I made it to floors that\Nwere higher than any of the other testers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.23,0:15:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.31,0:15:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew about the boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.09,0:15:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because I fought tons of monsters with\Nway more sword skills on higher floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.77,0:15:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know a bunch of other things, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.93,0:15:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than any info broker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.25,0:15:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.79,0:15:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's true, then you're\Nworse than a beta tester.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.83,0:15:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a goddamn cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.59,0:15:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.67,0:15:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a beta tester and a cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a beater!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.99,0:15:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A beater.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's good. I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.99,0:15:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.90,0:15:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can call me a beater.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.31,0:15:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just make sure you don't confuse\Nme with those beta testers anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.61,0:15:49.48,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnBougan Book SSi\c&HC6F2FF&\blur0.5\fscy80\fs22\frz20.36\pos(675.073,152.038)}Coat of Midnight
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.85,0:15:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.33,0:16:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were the inspiration\Nfor that weird beater handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.31,0:16:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Playing the villain was brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.25,0:16:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By doing that, you took the\Nheat off the other beta testers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.71,0:16:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must have been hard to\Ntake that on, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.67,0:16:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, it wasn't all that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.09,0:16:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stacia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.31,0:16:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chirico!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.01,0:16:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chirico! Sachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.71,0:16:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hard part
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.63,0:16:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was making friends and\Nhaving to watch them die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.15,0:17:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.23,0:17:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You getting used to it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.59,0:17:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I'm getting the hang of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.49,0:17:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still having a hard time opening\Nmy eyes underwater, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.75,0:17:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That part's always weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.49,0:17:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, you'll get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.89,0:17:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we take a little break now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.79,0:17:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.95,0:17:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's definitely summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.09,0:17:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It totally is, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.13,0:17:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it supposed to always be\Nsummer in that quest we're going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.33,0:17:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's in the southern\Npart of Soph territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.83,0:17:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard it gets pretty hot there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.77,0:17:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard it's loaded with\Nall kinds of new traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.57,0:17:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.55,0:17:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better figure out a\Nway to keep Kirito from
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.87,0:17:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going aggro and leaving\Nus all in the dust again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.17,0:17:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I've been meaning to\Nask you guys something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.23,0:17:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you were stuck in the game,\Nhow did you all meet my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.25,0:17:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was surrounded by a\Nbunch of monsters and he
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.97,0:17:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,saved me just as I was\Nabout to get attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.75,0:18:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pina! Pina! Pina!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.11,0:18:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pina!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.11,0:18:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pina!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.99,0:18:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.61,0:18:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.57,0:18:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peter...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.33,0:18:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you do all this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you, but only if you\Npromise not to laugh, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.61,0:19:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.73,0:19:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.89,0:19:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because you look\Nlike my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.21,0:19:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.03,0:19:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only Kirito would say\Nsomething as goofy as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.95,0:19:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, compared to you, Suguha,\NKeiko doesn't look a thing like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.15,0:19:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about us are you comparing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.61,0:19:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, after that, Kirito took me on a\Nquest to find a rare item to save Pina.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.85,0:20:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, pick it up.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.00,0:20:13.83,Signs,K,0,0,0,,{\fnBougan Book SSi\c&H939597&\blur0.4\fs23\pos(667.725,375.835)}Pneuma Flower
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.67,0:20:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure it'll bring Pina\Nback to life? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.45,0:20:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.91,0:20:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a bunch of strong\Nmonsters lurking around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.71,0:20:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's revive it when we get back to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.75,0:20:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Pina would want it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.23,0:20:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.39,0:20:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing's not that strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.37,0:20:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me! Don't save me!\NBut don't look! Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll be... difficult. Help me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.13,0:20:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.11,0:20:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.29,0:20:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I first met your brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.09,0:20:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it wasn't half as dramatic\Nas what happened to Silica.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.75,0:21:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Lizbeth's blacksmith shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.03,0:21:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.79,0:21:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if you do custom orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.49,0:21:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look like\Nhe has that much money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.97,0:21:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.97,0:21:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, metal prices\Nare kind of high these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.95,0:21:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I'm not worried about the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.37,0:21:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want the best sword you\Ncan make as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.23,0:21:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I make a lot of different swords,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.25,0:21:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you have any idea of the quality\Nof swords you want, I can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.79,0:21:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sure. One sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.89,0:21:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I'm looking for something either the\Nsame quality or better than this. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.55,0:21:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An elucidator!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.89,0:21:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,monster drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.80,0:21:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.72,0:21:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.93,0:21:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the best sword I ever forged.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.73,0:21:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call it my
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.33,0:21:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.24,0:21:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.16,0:21:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a little light.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.07,0:21:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.09,0:22:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used a speed type metal to forge it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.79,0:22:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to test it if\Nit's cool. Test it how?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.03,0:22:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, it's durability.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.37,0:22:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.01,0:22:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you break your sword,\NI'm not responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.15,0:22:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it breaks, then that's too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.43,0:22:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just walked in and\Ndestroyed my best sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.59,0:22:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about a bad first impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.91,0:22:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.57,0:22:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how he is, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.69,0:22:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always doing the one thing\Nyou'd least expect. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.05,0:22:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like the time we fell into\Na dragon's lair and he
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.31,0:22:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,handed me a pile of its poop\Nlike it was no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.13,0:22:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Definitely not a good memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.77,0:22:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with you there, Liz. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.89,0:22:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, there were some good memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.65,0:23:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.27,0:23:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.33,0:23:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though you and me are just these\Nones and zeros in a virtual world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.23,0:23:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.35,0:23:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.75,0:23:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.13,0:23:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.37,0:23:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.83,0:23:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't freak out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.25,0:23:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm falling in love with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.47,0:23:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hear a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.39,0:23:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.53,0:23:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.53,0:23:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.47,0:23:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell Asuna what you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.75,0:23:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liz...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.66,0:23:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.85,0:24:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The getting over it part,\Nthat's gonna take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.67,0:24:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until I do, promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.01,0:24:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise me you'll put\Nan end to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.21,0:24:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till then, I'll keep doing what I do best.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.65,0:24:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.55,0:24:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.07,0:24:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he's flirting with that\Ncute counselor right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.61,0:24:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that? Right there. What? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.63,0:24:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right there, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.93,0:24:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.23,0:24:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those coordinates, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.23,0:24:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see a boss raid, all the high-level\Nplayers, and who do you think that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.29,0:24:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.69,0:24:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are, the strongest\Nsolo player in the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.55,0:24:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,joining a raid party to fight a boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.65,0:24:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you understand why I\Nwas surprised to see you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.55,0:24:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you shouldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.05,0:24:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With four bosses, being a high-level\Nsolo player didn't mean jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.35,0:24:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You needed help.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.63,0:24:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were bosses that posed a\Nthreat, even if you were in a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.15,0:25:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like Illfang the Kobold\NLord, the floor wand boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.59,0:25:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His level was so high,\Nhe almost wiped us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.45,0:25:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Diago, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.35,0:25:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.11,0:25:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.59,0:25:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was Gleam Eyes,\Nthe boss on floor 74.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.07,0:25:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beat it using my dual-wielding skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.77,0:25:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I came this close to getting\Nmyself killed in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.41,0:26:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.09,0:26:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starburst stream!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.15,0:26:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of skill is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.27,0:26:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.27,0:26:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta go faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.51,0:27:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that was just the bosses.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.57,0:27:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in Aincrad, there was\Nsomething even scarier.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.21,0:27:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.12,0:27:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.05,0:27:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other players.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.03,0:27:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.75,0:27:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.66,0:27:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bosses' parameters were intimidating.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.29,0:27:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in the end, they were just programs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.83,0:27:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you figured out their attack\Npatterns, you could deal with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.31,0:27:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since they couldn't leave their\Ndungeons, you could always bail.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.47,0:27:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But players, red players, were human too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.45,0:27:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they were always coming\Nup with new ways to PK you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.81,0:27:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they killed lots of players.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.69,0:27:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.57,0:28:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep struggling?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.61,0:28:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid of dying after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.81,0:28:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm just not ready yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.95,0:28:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.67,0:28:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the way I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.45,0:28:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die! Die! Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.27,0:28:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't just the fights\Nwith red players, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.25,0:28:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found myself in hairy situations\Nand straight up duels, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.41,0:28:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may be the top guild, but we barely\Nget by with the amount of troops we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.51,0:29:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His shield?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.97,0:29:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your reaction time is very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.59,0:29:36.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.37,0:30:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Heathcliff, the leader of\Nthe Knights of the Blood Oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.81,0:30:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was brilliant, one of\Nthe top players in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.69,0:30:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and what's ironic is,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.73,0:30:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was my duel with him that tipped\Nme off about his true identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.45,0:30:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made a little something for\Neveryone, so dig in! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.21,0:30:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I brought along\Nsome lunch to share too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.53,0:30:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help yourselves, do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.21,0:30:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.43,0:30:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.95,0:30:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.86,0:30:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says to start without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.19,0:30:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.19,0:30:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just put Kirito's\Nshare in my stomach, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.17,0:30:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't eat up all his food.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.81,0:30:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.72,0:30:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to leave some for him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.59,0:30:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.31,0:30:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.22,0:30:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna's lunch is so adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.27,0:30:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that's the\Nkind of girl Kazuto likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.45,0:30:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the kind that are all\Nfeminine and can cook good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.85,0:31:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong,\NSuguha? Huh? Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.13,0:31:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just wondering how you\Nand my brother met at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.53,0:31:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never told me, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.35,0:31:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, tell us how you guys met. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.71,0:31:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.89,0:31:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just told you, so it's only fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.91,0:31:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.82,0:31:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only one here who\Nhasn't talked about it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.09,0:31:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, since you put it\Nthat way... Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.87,0:31:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we first met in a town called Tolbana.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.27,0:31:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was on floor one at a boss raid\Nmeeting, and I sort of brushed him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.21,0:31:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the time, all I could think\Nabout was clearing the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.43,0:31:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think these taste good? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.45,0:31:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I came to this town, I end\Nup eating at least one a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.85,0:31:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I got a trick\Nto make it taste better.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.59,0:31:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.67,0:31:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try it with some of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.73,0:32:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.73,0:32:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He taught me that even though\Nwe were stuck in Aincrad,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.43,0:32:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could still find ways to enjoy life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.23,0:32:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.47,0:32:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the assault team's working\Ntheir butts off to clear the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.13,0:32:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where do I find you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.65,0:32:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out here, taking a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.59,0:32:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you're a solo player,\Nyou should take this more soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.21,0:32:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bet you didn't know this\Nis Aincrad's nicest season.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.11,0:32:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's weather is at its optimal setting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.53,0:32:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.44,0:33:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be a waste to have to go\Nto work on a day like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.55,0:33:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.46,0:33:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.69,0:33:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you even understand what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.19,0:33:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every day here is another\None lost in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.29,0:33:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but right now, we're\Nnot in the real world, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.29,0:33:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're alive in Aincrad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.63,0:33:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.65,0:33:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that breeze feel good?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.71,0:33:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.97,0:33:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.29,0:33:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weather's always the same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.61,0:33:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you laid down on the grass for\Na little bit, you'd understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.07,0:34:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.01,0:34:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.97,0:34:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.88,0:34:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking a nap in the middle of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.61,0:34:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some people sure got it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.27,0:34:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couple of lazy losers, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.01,0:34:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.85,0:34:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.41,0:34:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You slept like a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.49,0:35:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get one meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.79,0:35:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.69,0:35:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you can eat, my treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.61,0:35:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll be even. Deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.41,0:35:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If everything happened\Nthe way you just said,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.85,0:35:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it sounds like you fell for\NKitty till before he fell for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.17,0:35:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,N-No, it wasn't like...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.01,0:35:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, don't deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.55,0:35:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember when you came to\Nget your sword sharpened?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.99,0:35:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were all sad because you\Nthought he wasn't into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.89,0:35:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how'd you snag him?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.23,0:35:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you chase him down\Nand confess your feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.17,0:35:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.33,0:35:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, where am I going to cook it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.23,0:35:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.77,0:35:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing not your place, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.87,0:35:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You even own any cookware?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.93,0:35:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.84,0:35:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because the main ingredient is special,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.87,0:35:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't have a problem if\Nwe used my place this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.61,0:35:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.99,0:35:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do you say you\Nand me team up again?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.93,0:35:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black's my lucky color this week anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.17,0:35:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.08,0:36:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have stuff you\Nhave to do for your guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.39,0:36:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just bail on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.65,0:36:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like we have any\Nleveling quotas to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.15,0:36:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then what about your bodyguard?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.99,0:36:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just ditch him.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:25.52,0:36:27.85,Signs,A,0,0,0,,{\fnBougan Book SSi\c&H828E95&\blur0.4\fs30\pos(652.371,528.168)}Asuna invites you to join her party.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.21,0:36:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The front lines are dangerous, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.93,0:36:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:41.28,0:36:42.19,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnBougan Book SSi\c&HACAEAF&\blur0.4\fs30\pos(763.734,188.168)\frz351.7}Asuna invites you to join her party.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.99,0:36:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I didn't think you'd\Nbe that aggressive about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.29,0:36:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you have to be that aggressive\Nto get a guy to pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.05,0:36:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.99,0:36:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, I was in love with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.57,0:37:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, that's the sweetest\Nthing I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.15,0:37:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, how far'd you guys go, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.63,0:37:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it was in-game, but\Nyou weren't married, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.63,0:37:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.54,0:37:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.07,0:37:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.99,0:37:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.03,0:37:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all my fault, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.23,0:37:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.14,0:37:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.05,0:37:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.35,0:37:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.33,0:37:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stay away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.93,0:37:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.07,0:38:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, my life belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.29,0:38:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give it up for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.13,0:38:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to stay with you until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.79,0:38:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I promise I'll do anything\Nto protect you, too. Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.83,0:38:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.03,0:38:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.43,0:38:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do everything I can to make\Nsure you get back to the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.71,0:38:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, could I stay\Nwith you for the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.93,0:38:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.73,0:38:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.73,0:39:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.35,0:39:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get undressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.57,0:39:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just sit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.37,0:39:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.71,0:39:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you smiling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.75,0:39:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just having a\Ndream about my old life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.13,0:39:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was weird, and the dream\NI had, everything in Aincrad,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.89,0:39:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everything that happened in meeting you was\Njust that, a dream, and I was so scared,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.31,0:39:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.01,0:39:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank God it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.61,0:39:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that sounds weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.81,0:39:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.19,0:39:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.65,0:39:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do, it's just, I don't want my\Nlife here to disappear is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.51,0:40:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last two years have\Nbeen very special to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.17,0:40:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realize that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.09,0:40:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Kirito, I was thinking, maybe we\Ncould leave the front lines for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.61,0:40:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.09,0:40:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.51,0:40:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like if we return to the battlefield\Nnow, something bad's gonna happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.67,0:40:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I'm just tired of it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.23,0:40:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.97,0:40:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I am too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.19,0:40:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the southwest of Floor 22,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.69,0:40:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's this tiny little\Nvillage by a lake and a forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.19,0:40:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could get a house together, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.77,0:40:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.57,0:40:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.35,0:40:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.27,0:41:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.35,0:41:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Earthda, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.05,0:41:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.25,0:41:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, we didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.45,0:41:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, we didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.03,0:41:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm so jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.77,0:41:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so lucky being all married\Nand having Yui, the cutest kid ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.51,0:41:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.95,0:41:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our pride and joy. Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.23,0:41:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're quite the doting\Nparent for a teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.07,0:41:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll take that\Nas a compliment, Smartie.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.87,0:41:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, we want to make Yui happy, too,\Nso we'll do our best on today's quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.51,0:41:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A-una-ki-to?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.49,0:41:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.11,0:41:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you doing in the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.37,0:41:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And do you know where\Nyour mom and dad are now?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.81,0:41:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.23,0:41:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.35,0:41:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.53,0:42:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.53,0:42:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I call you, Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.79,0:42:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.17,0:42:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.08,0:42:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you can call me Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.85,0:42:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you say Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.01,0:42:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.13,0:42:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.95,0:42:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.23,0:42:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.09,0:42:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.21,0:42:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a little hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.15,0:42:28.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you call me\Nwhatever's easier for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.49,0:42:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.49,0:42:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.47,0:42:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.23,0:42:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.43,0:42:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.21,0:42:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Mommy. That works.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.33,0:42:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.15,0:42:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.89,0:42:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.81,0:42:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what about breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.15,0:42:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.31,0:43:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui? Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.37,0:43:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.01,0:43:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.45,0:43:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.73,0:43:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.17,0:43:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mental Health Counseling\NProgram Prototype 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.91,0:43:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Code name: Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.07,0:43:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.99,0:43:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You aren't just some program anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.43,0:43:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The system can't control you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.31,0:43:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, if you want something,\Nall you have to do is say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.63,0:43:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, tell us what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.51,0:43:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.59,0:43:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.05,0:43:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to stay with you forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.05,0:43:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy! Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.87,0:43:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.67,0:44:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be together forever, Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.41,0:44:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.81,0:44:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, you're our child.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.19,0:44:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.91,0:44:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.49,0:44:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The system was about to reject\NYui's admin credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.07,0:44:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing I could do was take her\Nprogram and turn it into a game object.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.21,0:44:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.57,0:44:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're holding Yui's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.79,0:44:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.75,0:44:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never told me about\Nhow you met Yui in SAO?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.71,0:44:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.87,0:44:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And ever since then, she's been our child.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.91,0:45:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.82,0:45:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get back in the pool\Nand practice some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.03,0:45:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Suguha.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.59,0:45:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A couple more lessons and you'll\Nbe swimming circles around Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.33,0:45:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.45,0:45:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to be young, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.79,0:45:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope those girls realize how lucky\Nthey are to be back in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.93,0:45:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'd be dead if it weren't\Nfor your heroic actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.03,0:45:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.15,0:45:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You figured out Heathcliff was\NAkihiko Kayaba, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.41,0:45:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If beating him at his own game wasn't\Na heroic act, I don't know what is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.07,0:45:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't seem like it\Nat the time, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.03,0:45:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.39,0:45:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, keep living.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.37,0:46:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Game over, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.23,0:46:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.63,0:46:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.97,0:46:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.27,0:46:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.03,0:46:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.51,0:46:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.99,0:47:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.90,0:47:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.82,0:47:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.39,0:47:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe in you, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.59,0:48:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.03,0:48:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.49,0:48:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.69,0:48:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.93,0:49:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On November 7th at 2.55pm,\Nthe game has been cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.67,0:49:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Repeat, the game has been cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.13,0:49:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The report states that after Kayaba\Nlost the final battle with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.01,0:49:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his brain was fried instantly\Nby his nerve gear rig.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.13,0:49:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The autopsy on him confirmed as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.51,0:49:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, there's one\Nthing that puzzles me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.69,0:49:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were killed in-game before\Nhe was, and yet you survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.55,0:49:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that due to a system-related\Nreason, or was it the will of Kayaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.63,0:49:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stunning view, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.55,0:50:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akihiko Kayaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.47,0:50:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At Argus Headquarters,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.41,0:50:06.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the SAO mainframe is in a room\Nfive floors below street level,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.95,0:50:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and right now it's deleting\Nall the data from its drives.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.61,0:50:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In about ten minutes, everything in\Nthis world will disappear forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.41,0:50:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all the players?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.97,0:50:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happens to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.41,0:50:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.85,0:50:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 6,147 players who survived the game up\Nto now were logged out a few seconds ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.73,0:50:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what about the 4,000 people who died?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.15,0:50:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.59,0:50:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll never return.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.37,0:50:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In any world, real or virtual,\Nonce you're dead, you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.41,0:50:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.32,0:50:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.35,0:50:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.83,0:50:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.51,0:50:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been so long I've\Nforgotten the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.25,0:50:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.53,0:51:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even before I developed a system for the\Nfull-dive environment, I dreamed of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.73,0:51:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A castle in a world that wasn't governed\Nby earthly laws and restrictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.81,0:51:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I poured my life into\Nmaking that world a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.95,0:51:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I created this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.67,0:51:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I got to see something that surpassed\Nanything I could have imagined for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.67,0:51:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My steel castle floating in\Nthe sky, I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.73,0:51:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how old I was when I became\Nobsessed with it I wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.87,0:51:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to leave the earth to fly\Nto that castle I wanted that
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.99,0:51:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more than anything else for\Nas long as I can remember
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.69,0:51:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what Kirito I want to believe\Nit's still out there that somewhere in some
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.25,0:51:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,other world my castle is still standing
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.63,0:51:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taller than ever. Yeah, maybe it still is.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.55,0:52:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I forget congratulations\Non clearing the game Kirito Asuna
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.33,0:52:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then I should probably get going now
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.77,0:52:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.77,0:52:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kayaba just left you two standing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.89,0:52:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He never gave you a reason\Nwhy he made SAO a death game?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.15,0:52:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Other than that castle story? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.23,0:52:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.89,0:52:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that from?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.83,0:52:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me guess—it's from your princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.53,0:53:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I think of what happened to the\Ntwo of you after you survived SAO,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.85,0:53:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it must have been quite an ordeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.03,0:53:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was thanks to a certain someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.47,0:53:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A crime was being\Ncommitted right inside ALO
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.63,0:53:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you had no idea it was even happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.19,0:53:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right—we dropped the\Nball and I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.33,0:53:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.71,0:53:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But by the time we found out what\NNobuyuki Sugo was up to, using those
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.75,0:53:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,300 comatose SAO players as\Nguinea pigs, guinea pigs,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.75,0:53:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd already gone in\Nand taken care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.65,0:53:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why couldn't you stop\Nhim from doing it in the
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.49,0:53:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.40,0:53:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like we weren't\Nkeeping tabs on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.41,0:53:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugo worked in the same research lab as
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.21,0:53:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kayaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.12,0:53:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there were 6,000 players coming\Nback from SAO that needed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.63,0:53:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were swamped,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.87,0:53:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,checking up on their health and getting\Nthem adjusted to the real world again.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.89,0:53:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our staff was stretched so thin,\Nmonitoring Sugo took a back seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.21,0:53:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.31,0:53:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,none of us even considered\Nthe possibility of him
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.63,0:53:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,building a lab inside the\Ngame for his experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.93,0:53:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in the real world,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.15,0:54:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he gave us no indication he was\Ninvolved with anything shady.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.13,0:54:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell me what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.47,0:54:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.38,0:54:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For starters, how do you\Nknow what Sugo was up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.31,0:54:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like I suspected\Nanything, Not at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.25,0:54:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Sugou.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.16,0:54:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's our company's Director of R&D.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.65,0:54:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Nobuyuki Sugou.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.51,0:54:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.45,0:54:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Kazuto Kirigaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.03,0:54:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kazuto, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.37,0:54:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard you and Asuna\Nwere lovers in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.73,0:54:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.01,0:54:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.35,0:54:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.89,0:54:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to make for one complicated\Nrelationship between you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.45,0:54:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you're curious, her father and\NI were discussing her marriage to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.61,0:55:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.15,0:55:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.25,0:55:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't take advantage of\NAsuna like this. Take advantage?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.95,0:55:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.97,0:55:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything, I have a right to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.47,0:55:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should explain why?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.11,0:55:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any idea what happened to Argus?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.85,0:55:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the company that developed SAO.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.27,0:55:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard they closed it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.49,0:55:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.31,0:55:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lawsuits and damages they\Nhad to pay took their toll.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.51,0:55:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The company was forced into bankruptcy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.25,0:55:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the maintenance of the SAO\Nservers was given to another company.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.55,0:55:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An electronics manufacturer, where\NAsuna's father, Shozo Yuki, is the CEO.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.91,0:55:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrecked progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.03,0:55:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I work for the company's\Nfull-dive technology R &D division.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.83,0:55:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, and without\Ngetting into specifics,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.99,0:56:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you could say I'm the\None keeping Asuna alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.31,0:56:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I ask you, is it wrong for me to expect\Na little compensation for my trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.27,0:56:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of promises\Nyou made to each other in the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.65,0:56:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I don't really care.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.51,0:56:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't ever want to see\Nyou here again. Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.67,0:56:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And from now on, stay away\Nfrom the Yuuki family.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.91,0:56:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're having the ceremony here\Non January 26th, a week from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.51,0:56:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save the date.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.81,0:56:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though you're not welcome here\Nanymore, you should come to the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.21,0:56:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.25,0:56:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.16,0:56:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hero, you've got the\Nroom all to yourself now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.41,0:56:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye and get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.69,0:56:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.93,0:56:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.84,0:56:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you think he was\Nsuspicious after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.43,0:56:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, because all I could\Nthink about was Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.33,0:56:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then a friend showed me a screenshot\Nwith an avatar that looked like her,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.77,0:56:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that was my only clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.43,0:57:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And based on that, you dove\Ninto ALO to try and save her?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.41,0:57:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it was all I had to go\Non, and that was enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.37,0:57:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need your help again.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.91,0:57:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.65,0:57:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Link, start!
Dialogue: 1,0:57:47.71,0:57:53.05,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\1c&H000000&\bord0\fnBatang\shad2\fs25\b1\pos(640,548)\fad(400,0)}ALfheim · Ancient Forest · Neutral Territory \NJanuary 20, 2025
Dialogue: 2,0:57:47.71,0:57:53.05,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fnBatang\fs25\b1\pos(640,548)\fad(400,0)}ALfheim · Ancient Forest · Neutral Territory \NJanuary 20, 2025
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.39,0:58:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back in another game, even after\Neverything I just went through.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.17,0:58:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.45,0:58:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.17,0:58:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.17,0:58:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.11,0:58:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.02,0:58:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.21,0:58:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.43,0:58:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.75,0:58:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember you, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.71,0:59:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.27,0:59:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy! Daddy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.21,0:59:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.63,0:59:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.07,0:59:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.61,0:59:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think your mommy might\Nbe stuck in here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.05,0:59:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.55,0:59:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean she's stuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.53,0:59:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After SAO was cleared, Asuna\Nnever woke up in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.21,0:59:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found out she was seen in Alfheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.65,0:59:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a picture, but\Nit's too blurry to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.83,0:59:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.79,0:59:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Go! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.69,0:59:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would someone tell me why three big\Nguys are fighting one single girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.59,0:59:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty uncool if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.85,0:59:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.19,0:59:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better get your ass out of here, noob.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.39,0:59:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.11,1:00:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if I remember correctly, the player\Ncalled Leafa is your younger sister, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.93,1:00:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's the last person I ever expected\Nto run into an ALO, especially that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.59,1:00:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.89,1:00:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just swam 25 meters\Nlike it was nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.21,1:00:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You even got your\Nbreathing technique down.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.05,1:00:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got the hang of it fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.95,1:00:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a good athlete.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.41,1:00:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.63,1:00:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.54,1:00:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you starting to miss your\Nbig brother or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.43,1:00:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.75,1:00:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just wondering why he's so late.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.61,1:00:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have a brother or sister,\Nbut I always wished I had one.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.47,1:00:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being close with him is nothing\Nto be embarrassed about.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.99,1:00:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think so? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.81,1:00:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the thing is, before\Nhe got trapped inside SAO,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.51,1:00:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we weren't really all that close.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.01,1:01:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see what those VR Miss he\Nwas so obsessed with were all about.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.73,1:01:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I started playing ALO.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.35,1:01:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the reason I'm\Nsuch a badass gamer now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.15,1:01:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito said he needed help getting to the\NWorld Tree, and you showed him the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.43,1:01:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but when I first met him in\Nthere, I had no idea he was my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.11,1:01:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He came off like just\Nanother obnoxious gamer.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.81,1:01:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kind of thought he was a dork, because\Nsometimes he'd get all broody and emo.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.89,1:01:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the weird thing is, I hung around.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.13,1:01:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why I did, but I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.93,1:01:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.41,1:01:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.43,1:01:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that I have to get to the\Ntop of the world tree as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.17,1:01:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, what's the rush?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.91,1:01:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sort of looking for someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.79,1:01:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.77,1:01:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No offense, but it's hard to explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.27,1:01:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Leafa.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.01,1:02:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the info you gave me\Nis really going to help.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.87,1:02:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.91,1:02:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you heading for the\NWorld Tree right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.29,1:02:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.45,1:02:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to see for myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.63,1:02:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alone that's crazy.\NIt's really far away and
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.45,1:02:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll have to fight a bunch of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.03,1:02:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you can handle yourself but.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.31,1:02:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey if you want i can take you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.91,1:02:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world tree was way far i can't believe
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.47,1:02:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we made it in three\Ndays it was crazy tough.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.77,1:02:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for helping him, Tsukaha.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.83,1:02:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you don't have to thank me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.95,1:02:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually had a blast.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.85,1:02:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was tough, but it was fun\Ngoing on an adventure with Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.11,1:02:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you getting tired yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.89,1:02:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm good to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.55,1:02:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mr. Tough Guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.29,1:03:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to break it to you, but flying's\Nout for both of us for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.79,1:03:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? How come?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.97,1:03:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that mountain way over there?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.31,1:03:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's above the altitude\Nlimit, so we can't fly over.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.11,1:03:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way anyone can pass\Nit is to go through the caves.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.45,1:03:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the toughest part of the trip\Nbetween Sylph Territory and Arun.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.05,1:03:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or so I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.43,1:03:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never even been this far myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.85,1:03:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess we walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.29,1:03:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These caves, are they long? Pretty long.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.67,1:03:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a mining town about halfway.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.63,1:03:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's neutral territory,\Nso we can rest there.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.07,1:03:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.27,1:03:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you good for time, or\Ndo you have to get back?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.37,1:03:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's seven at night in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.85,1:03:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can keep going for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.67,1:03:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.58,1:03:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can too, so let's keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.11,1:03:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since we're here,\Nwe should rotate out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.67,1:03:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, rotate? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.63,1:03:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We take turns logging out and\Nresting while the other keeps watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.01,1:03:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't log out when you're\Nin the field, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.55,1:03:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we have to take turns logging out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.69,1:03:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The person who stays behind\Nguards the other's avatar.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.91,1:03:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.97,1:03:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies first.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.13,1:04:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to get back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.09,1:04:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.95,1:04:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that I'm in love\Nwith him or anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.75,1:04:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or that I've got someone\Nto go on adventures with.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.57,1:04:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm just excited I get\Nto go places in a new world.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.77,1:04:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what'd you think of him after that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.85,1:04:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still didn't know who he was, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.95,1:04:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think he was awesome or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.31,1:04:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.37,1:05:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess, if anything, I\Nthought he was really fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.19,1:05:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later on, I saw how focused\Nhe was during battle,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.09,1:05:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way more than anyone I'd ever seen before.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.65,1:05:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.27,1:05:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we lose, it'll just mean a\Ncouple extra hours of flying!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.53,1:05:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's give up while we can!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.81,1:05:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.15,1:05:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm alive, I'm not\Ngonna let anyone in my party die.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.23,1:05:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let that happen again.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.69,1:05:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell what's he\Ndoing when I realized
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.99,1:05:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why he took those battles so seriously?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.93,1:05:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because there was someone he was trying to
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.81,1:05:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,protect I thought this is\Na guy I can believe in.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.19,1:05:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a game in the end. Anything\Ngoes. Right if you want to kill, you kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.55,1:06:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you want to steal you steal a lot of\Npeople think like that more than I care to
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.79,1:06:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know and in a way I get it even I used
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.09,1:06:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to think like that but none of it's true
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.59,1:06:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in a virtual world there's things you have\Nto protect because it's a virtual world
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.99,1:06:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone special taught me that\Nif you give into your impulses
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.03,1:06:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In here it's gonna change who\Nyou are in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.15,1:06:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The player and the character\Nare one and the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.29,1:06:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leafa, you're a good person,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.97,1:06:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I wanna be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.27,1:06:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it doesn't matter what the reason is.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.75,1:06:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell I'd ever\Nattack a friend for my own benefit.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.93,1:06:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't live with myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.23,1:06:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't matter what the odds were.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.77,1:06:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother would never turn his back on\Na fight if it was for the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.87,1:06:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I knew he could\Nnever lose. Ah! Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.73,1:07:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.29,1:07:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I think it's great\Nyou guys are close and all,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.19,1:08:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I get the feeling you're a little\Ntoo close, know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.05,1:08:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.31,1:08:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, shouldn't I\Nget back to practicing?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.47,1:08:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard the lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.71,1:08:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get back to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.23,1:08:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I'd known before I fell in love.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.69,1:08:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.77,1:08:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kazutou?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.49,1:08:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.37,1:08:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugu?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.07,1:08:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suguha?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.77,1:08:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.35,1:08:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.45,1:08:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.61,1:08:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugu!
Dialogue: 1,1:08:43.00,1:08:43.82,Signs,K,0,0,0,,{\fnBougan Book SSi\c&H93918F&\blur0.5\fs32\frz346.5\pos(985.677,129.883)}Are you sure you want to log out?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.27,1:08:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugu!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.71,1:08:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.83,1:08:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.77,1:08:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.77,1:08:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I betrayed the feelings I had!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.77,1:08:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I betrayed the love I felt for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.61,1:09:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I met Kirito,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.15,1:09:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought finally I could give up on\Nall these feelings I have for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.35,1:09:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.51,1:09:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already had!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.23,1:09:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now I'm... Love?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.99,1:09:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I mean love?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.45,1:09:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you and me, we're...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.91,1:09:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.35,1:09:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said no, we're not!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.75,1:09:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're not really my\Nbrother and I'm not your sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.61,1:09:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've known all along, for\Nthe last two years anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.81,1:09:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you quit Kendo, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.95,1:09:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why you started avoiding me?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.17,1:09:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because you knew the\Nwhole time, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.27,1:09:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pushed me away because I'm\Nnot your real sister, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.23,1:09:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.87,1:09:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's how it is,\Nwhy do you care about me now?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.53,1:09:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.15,1:09:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so happy you came back from SAO.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.13,1:09:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was happy because you were being nice to\Nme again, just like when we were little.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.43,1:10:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It felt like you were\Nfinally giving me a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.57,1:10:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.97,1:10:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, if this is how it is, I wish\Nyou'd kept on being a jerk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.45,1:10:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had, I wouldn't have\Nrealized how I felt about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.31,1:10:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have felt sad and\Njealous when I found out about her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.85,1:10:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't have tried forgetting about
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.07,1:10:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you and falling in love\Nwith Kirito instead!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.65,1:10:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.67,1:10:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.77,1:10:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.99,1:11:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.99,1:11:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.73,1:11:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.15,1:11:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I wanted to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.55,1:11:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I just didn't know\Nhow to go about doing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.29,1:11:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I was going to throw the duel.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.43,1:11:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.67,1:11:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.91,1:11:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry too
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.89,1:12:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think my problem is I never really\Ncame back to the real world after SAO
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.73,1:12:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I can't come back until she wakes up\Nin a way the game hasn't ended for me yet
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.45,1:12:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I guess that's why?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.01,1:12:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still haven't figured out how\NI fit in at home or with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.41,1:12:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.15,1:12:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when you do, I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.15,1:12:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how long it takes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.17,1:12:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting for the day\Nyou come back to us for real.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.75,1:12:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until then, I'll help you in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.39,1:12:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Suguha?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.73,1:12:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't learn how to\Nswim unless you practice!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.07,1:12:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.49,1:12:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so thanks to your sister's help.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.89,1:12:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You finally reached the world tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.59,1:12:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the report it says Sugo's grand quest?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.25,1:12:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was designed to be impossible to clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.31,1:13:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But somehow you cleared it on your own!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.73,1:13:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And went on to rescue Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.23,1:13:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not how it happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.55,1:13:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't clear it alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.11,1:13:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm almost there!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.23,1:13:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little further?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.45,1:13:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.29,1:13:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cats!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.11,1:14:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cats!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.09,1:14:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Outro music
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.05,1:14:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.11,1:14:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's using a dark magic spell!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.41,1:14:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Dragoons, get ready\Nto choke these suckers!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.83,1:15:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stealth warriors, prepare\Nto engage the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.39,1:15:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire breath, attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.85,1:15:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fenrir storm, fire at will!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.17,1:15:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cleared the quest, thanks to\NLeafa and Recon, Sakuya and Alicia,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.75,1:15:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and all the Sylph and Cats warriors.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.07,1:15:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for them, I would have\Nnever been able to reach Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.11,1:15:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.15,1:15:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then Sugou, a.k.a.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.25,1:16:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oberon the Fairy King, appeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.73,1:16:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usually I wouldn't think it possible\Nfor a player to beat the Game Master.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.75,1:16:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, you're an unusual player.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.85,1:16:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.85,1:16:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.89,1:16:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.80,1:16:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I was hoping for!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.72,1:16:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't get NPC girls\Nto make faces like that!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.35,1:16:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you smell lovely.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.19,1:16:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Figuring out how to replicate the way\Nyou smell in real life was a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.33,1:16:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't even get me\Nstarted on how hard it was to
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.87,1:16:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get an analyzer into your\Nhospital room undetected.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.87,1:16:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from her!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.93,1:16:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.97,1:16:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.97,1:16:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you stay down and\Ngrovel like a good little doggy?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.81,1:16:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cait!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.51,1:17:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System command, change the pain\Nabsorber from level 10 to level 8.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.41,1:17:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurts, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.61,1:17:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll increase the pain gradually to\Ngive you something to look forward to.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.07,1:17:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.43,1:17:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once it drops below level three, it'll\Nstart affecting your body in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.41,1:17:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for you...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.33,1:17:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yummy. How sweet.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.13,1:17:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugou!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.55,1:17:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.75,1:17:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You BASTARD!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.15,1:17:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you! You hear?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.31,1:18:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.61,1:18:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.67,1:18:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.05,1:18:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm facing reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.33,1:18:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you are giving up.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.01,1:18:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the power of a system you once defied.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.41,1:18:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What choice do I have?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.43,1:18:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a player.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.17,1:18:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's the GM.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.55,1:18:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then our battle was... What? A joke?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.51,1:18:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember how\Nyou showed me the power
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.97,1:18:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the human will was\Nsuperior to the system?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.85,1:18:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How you showed me the\Npossibilities of the future?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.43,1:18:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.31,1:18:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up, Kirito. Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.43,1:18:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,GMs are the supreme rulers\Nof the worlds they create.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.93,1:18:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as long as they're in that world,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.11,1:19:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they can access the powers\Nof a god if they want.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.57,1:19:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, it's the system\Nthat gives them their power.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.21,1:19:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not something they\Nhad to win or hone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.55,1:19:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But real power is something\Nthat's only found in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.13,1:19:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true in the virtual\Nworld, and the real one.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.59,1:19:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanna go get some ice cream?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.81,1:19:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds ice, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.49,1:19:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, Sugou\Noverestimated the power he got.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.05,1:19:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why he self-destructed.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.41,1:19:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.69,1:19:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.15,1:19:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for what happened next, you know\Neverything there is to know about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.83,1:19:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better get going.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.65,1:19:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to meet the\Nothers in ALO after this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.67,1:19:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be late.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.17,1:20:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you go, I have one more question.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.93,1:20:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard about something called the Seed.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.51,1:20:06.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you heard of it?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.39,1:20:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.09,1:20:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you around, Kirito.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:22.94,1:20:27.94,Signs,bord,0,0,0,done,{\blur1.5\1c&H000000&\bord0\fnBatang\shad2\fs25\b1\fad(470,470)\pos(538.286,610)}July 25, 2025\h\h\h\hALO, Turle Island
Dialogue: 2,1:20:22.94,1:20:27.94,Signs,bord,0,0,0,done,{\blur0.5\fnBatang\fs25\b1\fad(470,470)\pos(538.286,610)}July 25, 2025\h\h\h\hALO, Turle Island
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.13,1:20:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.39,1:20:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never appreciated the difference between
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.83,1:20:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in-game time and real-world\Ntime as I do now. Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.43,1:20:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's night IRL right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.13,1:20:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, because it's a perfect\Nday at the beach here!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.57,1:20:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those blue skies!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.79,1:20:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that white sand, and those gentle\Nwaves, and that warm sun, and that view.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.75,1:20:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, dogs?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.91,1:20:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.15,1:20:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.06,1:20:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a problem with my suit?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.01,1:20:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's the incoming wave!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.63,1:21:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are multiple feet ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.19,1:21:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get you back!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.85,1:21:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pain, show her your water breath!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.79,1:21:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higher at will!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.83,1:21:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold, the power of Rita!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.03,1:21:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's taking care well!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.35,1:21:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leafa, you gonna be okay or\Ndo you need more practice?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.97,1:21:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm good to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.53,1:21:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.83,1:21:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or as long as I can touch the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.45,1:21:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you look more confident.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.07,1:21:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, about where we're going today.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.45,1:21:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was gonna ask you, any idea how\Nfar under this dungeon's supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.53,1:21:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty far down.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.89,1:21:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I heard it was\Naround a hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.77,1:21:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hundred?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.93,1:22:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm okay, I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.71,1:22:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for Yui, after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.11,1:22:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Leafa.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.55,1:22:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, the second Kirito saw the king\Nof all fish come storming out of the lake,
Dialogue: 1,1:22:15.63,1:22:20.64,Signs,bord,0,0,0,done,{\1c&H000000&\bord0\fnBatang\shad2\fs26\blur1.5\b1\fad(470,470)\pos(660.286,610)}July 25, 2025\h\h\h\hYggdrasil City
Dialogue: 2,1:22:15.63,1:22:20.64,Signs,bord,0,0,0,done,{\fnBatang\fs26\blur0.5\b1\fad(470,470)\pos(660.286,610)}July 25, 2025\h\h\h\hYggdrasil City
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.93,1:22:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he screamed so loud!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.69,1:22:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.59,1:22:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you're so exaggerating.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.23,1:22:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went, whoa, but that's\Nabout as loud as I got.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.73,1:22:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky, I wish I could have\Nseen the king of fish, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.27,1:22:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, once the new\NAincrad opens up on floor 22,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.61,1:22:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're going to buy another cabin and\Nhave another contest at the lake.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.91,1:22:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait till you see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.09,1:22:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fish is so ginormous, it's scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.59,1:22:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So scary, you might cry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.37,1:22:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no I won't!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.63,1:22:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say it's big, but when you\Nfactor in the area of the lake,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.51,1:22:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it can't possibly be as big\Nas a whale in the real world!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.47,1:22:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, have you seen a real whale before?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.95,1:23:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I just estimated the size of one\Nusing measurements and video data I found.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.39,1:23:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could see real\Nworld things like you two,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.43,1:23:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but since I can't, I just\Nhave to make do with my data.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.15,1:23:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.15,1:23:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.09,1:23:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only Alfheim had whales.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.37,1:23:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you'd get a kick out of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.37,1:23:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They really are gigantic.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.37,1:23:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They jump out of the ocean and land\Nwith a big splash and - Hold the phone!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.07,1:23:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.65,1:23:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just remembered something. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.59,1:23:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the south of Sylph Territory, there's\Nsupposed to be a quest with a whale in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.83,1:23:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, can we go?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.07,1:23:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we went, then maybe\NI'd get to ride a whale.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.91,1:23:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's probably not a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.45,1:23:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kirito, you absolutely 100\N% sure this quest is for real?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.45,1:23:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if not, man, you're\Ngoing to break Yui's heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.69,1:23:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it turns out to be a\Njellyfish or a sea butterfly,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.49,1:23:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's going to be lamer than hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.57,1:23:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's a giant sea butterfly,\Nthat would still be pretty rad.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.11,1:23:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You find anything on it, Agil?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.93,1:23:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not much.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.84,1:24:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The quest's way out on\Nthe edge of the world map.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.31,1:24:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried, man, but there's not a whole\Nlot of people who know about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.21,1:24:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only thing I could confirm\Nis the part about a big-ass
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.45,1:24:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sea monster showing up at the\Nend that's all so at least
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.59,1:24:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we got something to look\Nforward to come on let's hit
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.21,1:24:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this hey guys it's time we\Nstart saddling up for the quest
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.49,1:24:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.35,1:24:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, are you going to\Nwear your armor on the quest?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.25,1:24:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Duh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.33,1:24:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are going into battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.77,1:24:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and change and\Nwe'll leave you behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.57,1:24:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.53,1:24:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you guys don't mind, I'd like\Nto be the party leader for today.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.03,1:24:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all know our objective,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.65,1:25:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so if anyone sees a whale out there,\Ncall it out and follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.39,1:25:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.53,1:25:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate this. Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.03,1:25:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ready? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.83,1:25:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to these\Ncoordinates, it should be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.93,1:25:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that it over there?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.71,1:25:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone, I'm gonna cast\Na water-breathing spell for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.09,1:26:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! What?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.11,1:26:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lima!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.95,1:26:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.71,1:26:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I think I see someone down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.49,1:26:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice, we got an NPC waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.39,1:26:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, if we're on an undersea quest,\Nthen I bet that NPC's a mermaid!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.89,1:26:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Miss Mermaid!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.09,1:26:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Klein's coming to save you!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.73,1:26:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I am, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.65,1:26:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.79,1:27:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not a mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.39,1:27:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.79,1:27:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see what this gentleman wants.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:08.22,1:27:10.60,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnBougan Book SSi\c&HA09D8D&\blur0.5\fs30\pos(548.296,151.835)\frz23.13}Do you want to begin the Deep Sea Invaders quest?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.09,1:27:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greetings, fairies from the surface world.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.11,1:27:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you possibly help\Nan old man with a dilemma?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.39,1:27:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Leafa?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.07,1:27:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.07,1:27:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just noticed the old man's name.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.25,1:27:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I've seen it somewhere before.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.11,1:27:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some thieves have stolen a present I\Nacquired for an old friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.39,1:27:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The temple behind me is their hideout.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.09,1:27:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you please retrieve it for\Nme before the rascals return?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.17,1:27:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.93,1:27:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am most grateful, kind fairy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.89,1:27:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The item in question is a pearl\Nabout this size. Cha-ching!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.63,1:27:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're not thinking\Nabout swiping it and selling it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.75,1:27:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not this time, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.27,1:28:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, my noble fairies.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.39,1:28:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you succeed in retrieving the\Npearl, I will reward you handsomely.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.21,1:28:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so it looks like this\Nwill be a search and seize.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.07,1:28:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there might be monsters\Nin there, so stay sharp.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.07,1:28:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're in the vanguard,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.65,1:28:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your sword strokes will be slower\Nunderwater, so compensate for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.83,1:28:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And rearguard, don't even think about\Nusing any lightning spells. Right!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.57,1:28:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, guys, let's move out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.61,1:28:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, Kirito, I don't think Leafa's\Ncool with this underwater stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.57,1:28:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you, like, keep a\Ncloser eye on her or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.15,1:28:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.25,1:29:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right, I should.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.19,1:29:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's so weird between us.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.27,1:29:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's just her and\Nme, everything's cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.61,1:29:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we're in a party\Ntogether, it's crazy awkward.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.43,1:29:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.67,1:29:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's your sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.97,1:29:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is be\Nyourself and look out for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.77,1:29:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, like a big brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.21,1:29:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.25,1:29:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when I first met her\Nin-game, I didn't even realize...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.37,1:29:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, you gotta be straight\Nup blind to miss that pit.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.73,1:29:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dumb asses.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.71,1:29:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he used to be a\Ntop player in the assault team.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.91,1:29:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.09,1:29:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he's rad no\Nmatter how clumsy he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.89,1:29:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy, in front of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.29,1:29:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the whale?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.95,1:29:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.33,1:29:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even close.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.07,1:29:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.31,1:29:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The head doesn't take damage.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.73,1:30:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it busy!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.49,1:30:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys attack its flakes!\NAim on it! Copy that!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.85,1:30:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go help them. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.11,1:30:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.13,1:30:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leafa!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.04,1:30:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back with Asuna\Nand hit it with spells!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.37,1:30:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After everyone went to all\Nthat trouble coaching me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.13,1:30:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch, Leafa!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.03,1:30:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I doing standing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.29,1:30:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said I'd follow my brother anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.01,1:30:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leafa, I'll be fine. I can do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.03,1:31:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.19,1:31:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito! Do something!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.31,1:31:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.55,1:31:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.79,1:32:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, when I was little,\NI fell into a pond. And...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.55,1:32:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember sinking...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.25,1:32:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.29,1:32:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugou!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.85,1:32:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asada!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.29,1:32:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.29,1:32:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.79,1:32:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kazuto, you saved me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.59,1:33:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.95,1:33:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if I never see another\Nstupid shrimp or crab again.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.71,1:33:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or a squid or octopus.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.69,1:33:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all that, we never did\Nget to see a whale. That sucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.29,1:33:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.47,1:33:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Yui sure looked\Nlike she was having fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.99,1:33:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.21,1:33:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got it back for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.31,1:33:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.49,1:33:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.69,1:33:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone else think it's\Nweird that we never saw
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.87,1:34:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those thieves the old\Nman was talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.69,1:34:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.37,1:34:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Don't give it to him!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.03,1:34:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.29,1:34:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's not a pearl, it's an egg.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.01,1:34:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.45,1:34:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plunderers of the deep sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.13,1:34:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, does that mean us?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.83,1:34:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, I'll\Ntake possession of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.99,1:34:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you won't hand it over,\Nyou'll leave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.15,1:34:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kraken!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.09,1:35:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea demon from Norse mythology!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.59,1:35:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A thousand thanks, my little fairies.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.75,1:35:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have retrieved the\Negg of the royal child.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.13,1:35:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not for the magic barrier,\NI would have done it myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.85,1:35:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, hand it over immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.29,1:35:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You old coot.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.55,1:35:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will not.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.83,1:35:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to put the egg\Nright back where we found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.71,1:35:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, you little pests, prepare\Nto spend eternity in a watery grave.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.55,1:35:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.45,1:35:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.95,1:36:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy, the stats of that\Noctopus are unbelievably high!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.63,1:36:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think there's a single floor boss\Nin New Aincrad with stats as high as that.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.05,1:36:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that spear.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.15,1:36:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.31,1:36:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you're still up to your old tricks.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.05,1:36:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I see you are still playing\Nlapdog to the minions of Aesir.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.45,1:36:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You disgrace your title, Lord of the Sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.23,1:36:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Lord of the Sea, and\Nyou are in my backyard.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.75,1:37:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, do you really wish to\Nfight me, Lord of the Abyss?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.05,1:37:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall withdraw for now,\Nbut take heed, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.15,1:37:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not over.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.37,1:37:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon, I shall claim\Nthe power of the child.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.91,1:37:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I will rise up against Aesir.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.07,1:37:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mark my words!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.49,1:37:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the egg of the one who will\Nsomeday rule over the seas and the sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.19,1:37:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall take it to a new resting place\Nwhere it will be safe from treachery.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.71,1:37:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, what the hell's\Ngoing on? Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.67,1:37:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We clear it or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.07,1:37:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm lost too.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.51,1:37:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does anyone know what the big guy\Nand the octopus were talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.97,1:37:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was not important.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.05,1:37:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, my noble fairies, I shall\Ntransport you back to your own world.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.47,1:38:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, what do you mean by transport?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.95,1:38:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Peeta, isn't this whale gigantic?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.41,1:38:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.32,1:38:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.24,1:38:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll
